You okay, Kaoru?

00:14:25.534 --> 00:14:26.934
Kaoru!

00:14:27.344 --> 00:14:30.744
How dare you do that to a lady's face!

00:14:30.744 --> 00:14:34.584
Why, you... Don't be so full of yourself,
just 'cuz your boobs are kinda big!

00:14:34.584 --> 00:14:35.984
Kaoru, stop!

00:14:35.984 --> 00:14:37.184
But, she!

00:14:37.184 --> 00:14:40.684
Even if you wanted to test yourself
against them, that went too far!

00:14:40.684 --> 00:14:41.484
Minamoto?

00:14:42.624 --> 00:14:43.694
Stop!

00:14:43.694 --> 00:14:44.924
Yes, stop!

00:14:44.924 --> 00:14:49.094
Mary, we don't want to cause any
more trouble with our allies!

00:14:49.094 --> 00:14:50.134
Ken!

00:14:50.134 --> 00:14:51.194
Ally?

00:14:51.194 --> 00:14:53.434
Minamoto is our friend!

00:14:53.434 --> 00:14:54.634
Friend?

00:14:54.634 --> 00:14:57.834
I made friends with him while you were fighting.

00:14:59.844 --> 00:15:03.504
Comericans can forget to be nice
to people they don't know.

00:15:03.574 --> 00:15:05.734
You're very kind to strangers.

00:15:07.284 --> 00:15:09.184
Oh, it was no trouble, really.

00:15:09.184 --> 00:15:10.554
How do you do...

00:15:10.554 --> 00:15:15.384
Mr. Minamoto, on-site supervisor
for BABEL's The Children, right?

00:15:16.894 --> 00:15:18.594
What's going on?

00:15:18.594 --> 00:15:20.064
Who are you?!

00:15:20.064 --> 00:15:24.584
I'm It. Ken McGuire, assigned to
Comerica's Japan esper team.

00:15:24.964 --> 00:15:26.864
And I'm It. Mary Ford, also on the team.

00:15:27.064 --> 00:15:29.304
We came here on business,

00:15:29.304 --> 00:15:31.704
and by coincidence spotted
BABEL's Children here, too.

00:15:32.074 --> 00:15:35.134
Japan's espers are no threat to me, are they?

00:15:35.344 --> 00:15:38.874
Try me sometime when my limiter's released!

00:15:38.874 --> 00:15:40.414
Kaoru, stop!

00:15:40.414 --> 00:15:42.014
Kaoru's right!

00:15:42.014 --> 00:15:43.484
We'll take you on anytime!

00:15:43.484 --> 00:15:44.754
Don't provoke her!

00:15:44.754 --> 00:15:45.854
But...

00:15:45.854 --> 00:15:49.814
These girls are top-level espers!
Insult them and you'll regret it!

00:15:53.394 --> 00:15:56.634
I guess it's true that Japan is full of lolicons.

00:15:56.634 --> 00:15:57.964
Hey! That's slander!

00:15:58.134 --> 00:15:59.434
So, your business is?

00:15:59.434 --> 00:16:01.204
We're chasing criminals.

00:16:01.204 --> 00:16:02.234
Criminals?

00:16:02.234 --> 00:16:04.874
Our mission is part of an international pursuit

00:16:04.874 --> 00:16:06.994
of criminals of Comerican citizenship.

00:16:07.574 --> 00:16:08.304
Ow!

00:16:13.444 --> 00:16:13.944
Mimicry!

00:16:13.944 --> 00:16:14.814
An esper!

00:16:14.814 --> 00:16:16.174
Peeping at us?!

00:16:16.784 --> 00:16:18.414
Meow.

00:16:19.284 --> 00:16:21.654
Oh, it's a cat.

00:16:22.054 --> 00:16:25.824
YOU SERIOUSLY THOUGHT
WE'D FALL FOR THAT?!

00:16:26.194 --> 00:16:28.524
Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:16:28.524 --> 00:16:30.934
He's the one we're after!

00:16:30.934 --> 00:16:32.394
You won't escape!

00:16:32.394 --> 00:16:34.524
Help me, Lige!

00:16:35.704 --> 00:16:37.494
Muto, we gotta run!

00:16:37.734 --> 00:16:40.144
Another boobulous foreign girl?!

00:16:40.144 --> 00:16:42.044
Careful! They're gonna teleport!

00:16:45.044 --> 00:16:46.814
That's a friendly way to run, huh?

00:16:46.814 --> 00:16:48.714
Can't be more than Level 3.

00:16:48.714 --> 00:16:50.684
COME BACK HERE!

00:16:51.784 --> 00:16:54.354
My collection of yukatas
worn by middle-aged men!

00:16:54.354 --> 00:16:56.324
She likes old guy yukatas?!

00:16:56.324 --> 00:16:57.654
People like that exist?!

00:16:57.654 --> 00:17:00.424
That explains where all the men's
yukatas were vanishing to.

00:17:00.724 --> 00:17:02.164
Let's run!

00:17:04.234 --> 00:17:06.794
Right... Children, released.

00:17:07.734 --> 00:17:08.594
<<RELEASED>>

00:17:16.574 --> 00:17:18.334
This is a world of relaxation!

00:17:19.044 --> 00:17:21.304
Criminals who disturb its peace...

00:17:21.984 --> 00:17:24.284
Will be finished in a businesslike way!

00:17:24.684 --> 00:17:27.344
The Absolutely Lovely Children!

00:17:28.454 --> 00:17:31.044
Special espers: The Liberty Bells!

00:17:31.194 --> 00:17:34.124
We're perfect partners who cover each
other's strengths and weaknesses!

00:17:34.194 --> 00:17:35.824
You'll never catch us!

00:17:35.824 --> 00:17:37.314
Water Dragon!

00:17:37.664 --> 00:17:40.464
PSYCHIC CRIMINAL EXTERMINATION ATTACK!

00:17:46.604 --> 00:17:48.694
Ah! Stop it!

00:17:57.384 --> 00:18:00.024
You have the right to remain silent!

00:18:00.024 --> 00:18:03.614
Your rights will be protected according
to the Comerican Constitution!

00:18:13.294 --> 00:18:14.604
With espers like that,

00:18:14.604 --> 00:18:17.634
it must be hard to shield
this place from peepers!

00:18:17.634 --> 00:18:18.934
You're one to talk.

00:18:18.934 --> 00:18:22.164
Everyone, dinner's ready!

00:18:22.374 --> 00:18:25.944
Really? Why don't you two join us?

00:18:25.944 --> 00:18:28.034
Your words are music to my ears!

00:18:30.214 --> 00:18:34.354
And now, a toast to the meeting
of BABEL with Ken and Mary!

00:18:34.354 --> 00:18:35.484
Cheers!

00:18:35.754 --> 00:18:37.744
Cheers!

00:18:41.094 --> 00:18:44.034
As thanks for catching those pervert espers,

00:18:44.034 --> 00:18:45.694
your meal's on the house!

00:18:45.964 --> 00:18:48.294
Yay!

00:19:01.614 --> 00:19:05.204
It's o-daikan play! Please, forgive me!

00:19:05.754 --> 00:19:07.884
You're just as much to blame!

00:19:07.884 --> 00:19:09.384
Lame!

00:19:09.384 --> 00:19:11.484
THIS is what real o-daikan play looks like!

00:19:11.854 --> 00:19:14.254
Kaoru, cut it out!

00:19:14.694 --> 00:19:18.394
Oh! Impressive! But I will not be beaten!

00:19:18.934 --> 00:19:21.804
By the way, where are the geisha?

00:19:21.804 --> 00:19:22.764
Geisha?

00:19:22.764 --> 00:19:27.004
I hear that geisha play baseball
at Japanese banquets.

00:19:27.004 --> 00:19:28.304
Strip Baseball?!

00:19:28.544 --> 00:19:30.644
Let's do it, Minamoto!

00:19:30.644 --> 00:19:33.144
Cut... it... out!

00:19:33.144 --> 00:19:35.144
C'mon! Nothing to be ashamed of!

00:19:35.144 --> 00:19:37.254
Um, what's "strip baseball"?

00:19:37.254 --> 00:19:38.214
Dunno.

00:19:40.824 --> 00:19:42.084
Naomi.

00:19:42.084 --> 00:19:43.694
Um, yes?

00:19:43.694 --> 00:19:49.094
We're forming a bond that goes
beyond supervisor and esper.

00:19:49.094 --> 00:19:52.464
Almost like family, don't you think?

00:19:52.664 --> 00:19:56.034
Hm... Like family... I suppose so.

00:19:56.034 --> 00:19:58.664
Yes, I'd definitely have to say we are.

00:19:58.804 --> 00:20:01.504
Right. Family. In that case, Naomi...

00:20:01.504 --> 00:20:03.304
Let's get into the family bath!

00:20:05.214 --> 00:20:07.944
Get lost, you drunken old fart!

00:20:08.144 --> 00:20:11.844
Oh, one of those Japanese
tsunderes I've heard about!

00:20:12.214 --> 00:20:13.184
No.

00:20:32.534 --> 00:20:36.304
Minamoto? Minamoto, are you in?

00:20:36.304 --> 00:20:38.604
Would you like to take a little walk?

00:20:39.674 --> 00:20:42.244
If you want Minamoto, he isn't in there.

00:20:42.244 --> 00:20:43.854
Natsuko!

00:20:43.854 --> 00:20:46.044
We agreed, no pulling any end runs!

00:20:46.254 --> 00:20:48.484
Um, uh, whatever could you mean?

00:20:48.654 --> 00:20:51.684
I can't let my guard down around
you for an instant, can I?

00:20:52.154 --> 00:20:56.994
Oh, you're just mad because you
couldn't do it first, huh, Natsuko?

00:20:56.994 --> 00:20:58.164
WHAT?!

00:20:58.164 --> 00:20:59.564
What?!

00:21:01.034 --> 00:21:03.294
But, where can Minamoto be?
But, where can Minamoto be?

00:21:06.434 --> 00:21:09.304
Whew! I can finally relax.

00:21:15.944 --> 00:21:18.154
Oh, it's you. Don't scare me like that.

00:21:18.154 --> 00:21:19.944
Hey! This is the men's bath!

00:21:20.114 --> 00:21:22.954
Don't be greedy! Let us in, too!

00:21:22.954 --> 00:21:24.624
Nobody else is around.

00:21:24.624 --> 00:21:25.994
We can do what we like.

00:21:25.994 --> 00:21:27.294
Jeez...

00:21:27.294 --> 00:21:29.594
Oh, I feel alive again!

00:21:29.864 --> 00:21:32.264
You're doing the creepy old guy thing, Kaoru.

00:21:33.334 --> 00:21:35.764
Oh! Look, it's so pretty!

00:21:39.274 --> 00:21:41.544
Well, I guess doing this once
in a while isn't so bad.

00:21:41.544 --> 00:21:43.704
You think the towel is just getting in the way.

00:21:44.544 --> 00:21:45.534
Hey! Shiho!

00:21:45.744 --> 00:21:48.144
Mr. Minamoto, you creep! That's dirty!

00:21:48.384 --> 00:21:51.614
What, Minamoto? If you wanted to
see, you should've just asked.

00:21:51.784 --> 00:21:52.944
Cut it out, you idiots!

00:21:53.014 --> 00:21:55.484
Quit making up stories about how people feel!

00:21:59.254 --> 00:22:01.594
Wow, Minamoto. That was unexpected.

00:22:01.594 --> 00:22:03.894
That was another hot spring convention.

00:22:19.444 --> 00:22:24.574
There's no point in hiding it

00:22:24.884 --> 00:22:28.944
I know everything

00:22:29.684 --> 00:22:35.124
It's no mystery, because

00:22:35.494 --> 00:22:40.894
I love you

00:22:41.134 --> 00:22:45.534
Go on, look at me

00:22:45.804 --> 00:22:50.104
Truly, the bond of love we share

00:22:50.104 --> 00:22:52.074
Is absolute!

00:22:52.314 --> 00:22:57.014
An eternal, unchanging

00:22:57.014 --> 00:23:03.654
Absolute declaration to the world
I'll shout from Everest!

00:23:03.654 --> 00:23:08.494
I've accepted it

00:23:08.494 --> 00:23:12.894
The bond of love we share

00:23:12.894 --> 00:23:15.104
Is absolute!

00:23:15.104 --> 00:23:19.534
My wish, when fortune smiles on me

00:23:19.834 --> 00:23:23.944
In San Pietro, I'll swear it to you

00:23:23.944 --> 00:23:26.744
An absolute declaration of love!

00:23:39.924 --> 00:23:40.994
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:40.994 --> 00:23:42.894
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:43.094 --> 00:23:44.724
You guys don't understand! That's why-

00:23:44.794 --> 00:23:45.954
If we listened, we wouldn't get it.

00:23:46.034 --> 00:23:46.964
So, just tell us!

00:23:47.034 --> 00:23:49.264
Don't just assume that life
is a bowl of cherries!

00:23:49.334 --> 00:23:51.474
We're a team! We're supposed
to support each other!

00:23:51.474 --> 00:23:52.804
Let me just touch you for a second.

00:23:52.804 --> 00:23:55.474
You guys are always like this!
I can't even look at you anymore!

00:23:55.474 --> 00:23:58.444
Hold it, Aoi, I have to discuss
a sudden solo mission for you.

00:23:58.714 --> 00:24:00.314
Zettai Karen Children!

00:24:00.314 --> 00:24:03.214
Episode 12: "Destination!
Teleport Japan's Future!"

00:24:03.214 --> 00:24:04.954
Although, more accurately,
it's going to be you and me.

00:24:04.954 --> 00:24:05.214
Destination!
Teleport Japan's Future!!
Although, more accurately,
it's going to be you and me.

00:24:05.214 --> 00:24:06.614
Destination!
Teleport Japan's Future!!
Just you and me, Minamoto?

00:24:06.614 --> 00:24:09.154
Destination!
Teleport Japan's Future!!
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

